    "q-73929": {
      "dom_id": "step-q73929",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "If $w=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}]$, then $5w=$",
      "worked_solution": "Multiplying each component of $w$ by $5,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5w & =5[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}5\\cdot 1 \\\\ 5\\cdot (-1) \\\\ 5\\cdot 3 \\\\ 5\\cdot (-4)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 15 \\\\ -20\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
